==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Lowkey]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Big Sal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*12 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 13.33~16 seconds<sup>400f~480f</sup>.
*3 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Paragon Cat]] is very good in this stage since it can knockback both the Big Sal and the Zir Zeals. General Anti-Zombie units like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife]] or [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Chief]] can easily kill the Zeals and Coffin Zoges, just make sure to bring Anti-Relic units like [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapsticks]] or [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|Masked Grandmaster Cat]] to kill Lowkey faster.

